<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>forrtnite</Major>
    <Description>Fortnite triple edits with keybinds e for edit. q for ramp o for roof l for floor and lmb for confirm/edit. look straight forwards with your pickaxe out, then hold W or your move forwards keybind and it will automatically triple edit for you. resolution 1920x1080 1600dpi 4.5% x and y sensitivity.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
